{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\ude80 \u2726 PILOT A STARSHIP INTO THE VOID \u2726 \ud83d\ude80</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the pilot of a starship venturing into a newly discovered dimension filled with <strong>vibrant energy</strong> and <strong>mysterious matter</strong>. As you navigate this neon wilderness, you'll encounter distress signals and opportunities to complete <strong>side missions</strong> that reward you with valuable resources and upgrades.<br>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/55abd9a428c19bcf2cfbdbebdbac636a.poster.avif?t=1773913598\" width=1170 height=828 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/55abd9a428c19bcf2cfbdbebdbac636a.webm?t=1773913598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/55abd9a428c19bcf2cfbdbebdbac636a.mp4?t=1773913598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2694\ufe0f \u2726 BULLET-HELL COMBAT \u2726 \u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against swarms of alien enemies and <strong>colossal bosses</strong>. Every fight is a test of your strategy. Collect resources to upgrade your starship <strong>in real-time</strong>. Master <strong>pixel-perfect</strong> bullet-hell gameplay and near-miss escapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>20 core systems</strong>, merge them to unlock <strong>16 devastating Hyper Powers</strong>, game-changing abilities that can turn the tide of any battle. No two runs are ever the same.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/19d4e69677042ea7c3d0bd58fa7378db.webp?t=1773913598\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/19d4e69677042ea7c3d0bd58fa7378db.poster.avif?t=1773913598\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=502 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfae \u2726 PLAY YOUR WAY \u2726 \ud83c\udfae</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>four difficulty levels</strong> that match your playstyle. Whether you're seeking a relaxed cosmic journey or a hardcore bullet-hell challenge, Void Resurgence adapts to you.<br>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/3cf12407cf6471ff0b869489a5fdb040.poster.avif?t=1773913598\" width=1170 height=838 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/3cf12407cf6471ff0b869489a5fdb040.webm?t=1773913598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/3cf12407cf6471ff0b869489a5fdb040.mp4?t=1773913598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2b50 \u2726 PROGRESSION &amp; COMPETITION \u2726 \u2b50</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is only the beginning. Earn <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> for your starship that carry over between runs. Unlock <strong>10 ship classes</strong>, each with different starting weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills against pilots from around the world. Compete in over <strong>420 global leaderboards</strong>. Prove your mastery and etch your name among the stars as a true ace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All Systems Online","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/